  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 605.02 Emergency Response Actions for Hazardous Waste Discharges",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 605.02 Emergency Response Actions for Hazardous Waste Discharges. The responsible party shall conduct emergency response actions for any hazardous waste discharge in accordance with RSA 147-A and Env-Hw 100 – 1400.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 600) #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
